---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/base-layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title={`${site.name}: ${site.tagline}`}
  description={site.description}
  canonical={`${site.baseUrl}/`}
>
  <div class="info-content">


    <h2>What is gptbash.com?</h2>
    <p>
      The main goal of this site is to preserve the original feel and spirit of the Polish bash.org.pl —
      a cult phenomenon in the history of the Polish internet. We archive funny IRC quotes,
      preserving the vibe and culture of those times for future generations. You’re also welcome
      to submit funny conversations from other communication channels (IM, chat, etc.).
      Just make sure your text is readable, following the style of other fortunes. All quotes
      are rated by registered users before approval and go through moderation
      (meaning every quote is reviewed by a moderator before publication).
    </p>

    <h2>Where did we come from?</h2>
    <p>
      This project grew out of nostalgia for bash.org.pl. Watch the video below
      to understand the phenomenon we’re trying to preserve:
    </p>
    <div class="video-container">
      <iframe 
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/C0C3NK55tI8" 
        title="YouTube video player" 
        frameborder="0" 
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
        allowfullscreen
        loading="lazy">
      </iframe>
    </div>


    <p style="margin: 10px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
      This site uses cookies for analytics (Google Analytics). See our{' '}
      <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
